{{Quote|The ''Halcyon'' starcruiser is the jewel of the Chandrila Star Line. Onboard the 100-cabin Corellian MPO-1400 model starcruiser, you'll voyage to the far reaches of the galaxy in legendary comfort and style. Recently refurbished and reoutfitted, the starcruiser combines modern conveniences with the romance of the age of exploration.|Chandrila Star Line|<ref name="Overview" />}}
The '''''Halcyon''''' was a [[Corellian]] passenger [[MPO-1400 Purgill-class star cruiser|MPO-1400 ''Purgill''-class star cruiser]] operated by [[Chandrila Star Line]].

==Characteristics==
[[File:TheHalcyonStarcruiser-ShipsOfTheGalaxy.jpg|thumb|left|250px|A cross-section view of the bow of the ''Halcyon''.]]
The ''Halcyon'' was a passenger liner owned by Chandrila Star Line.<ref name="Overview" /><ref name="SWGS Datapad" /> Being an MPO-1400 model,<ref name="Overview" /><ref name="SWGS Welcome Video" /> manufactured by the [[Corellian Engineering Corporation]], and belonging to the family of [[Purrgil-class starcruiser|''Purrgil''-class starcruisers]], the ''Halcyon'' was distinguished as the "jewel" of the cruise liner company.<ref name="Overview" />

The ''Halcyon'' was propelled by an array of 13 engine units, whilst also possessing a ventral hanger bay, similar to that of the infamous [[Imperial-class Star Destroyer|line]] of [[Star Destroyer]]s of the [[Galactic Empire]].<ref name="D23 Expo 2019" /> The vessel possessed a pair of [[docking ring]]s, along the port and starboard sides of its spine, in addition to two of both sides of its bow, which were designated for [[Launch Pod Dock]]s. The docks onboard, equipped with [[airlock]]s, would accept the passengers of the multiple [[Launch Pod]]s from a [[planet]]-bound [[Galactic Starcruiser Terminal|terminal]], as they rendezvous with the Star Cruiser.<ref name="Overview" /> Another set of docks, referred to as [[Transport Dock]]s, were designated for transport shuttles docking with the [[starship]]. During [[34 ABY]], [[Black Spire Outpost transport|transport shuttles]] belonging to the Batuu Transport Company would service the passengers aboard the ''Halcyon'', by taking individuals to the [[Batuu]] hub of [[Black Spire Outpost]] during denoted excursion periods.<ref name="SWGC Itinerary">{{Disney|subdomain=disneyworld|domain=go.com|url=star-wars-galactic-starcruiser/experience-highlights/#itinerary|text=''Star Wars'': Galactic Starcruiser - Itinerary}}</ref>

==History==
===The romantic age of exploration===
[[File:MPO-1400HalcyonVentralSurface.png|thumb|left|250px|The ventral surface of the ''Halcyon'' starcruiser]]
The ship was commissioned in [[241 BBY]].<ref name="Commission Date" /> Its construction was overseen by [[Shug Drabor]]<ref name="Halcyon 1" /> at the [[Santhe Shipyards]] in [[Coronet City]] on [[Corellia]]<ref name="TFN Review" />, who incorporated his favorite number into the ship's unique design, featuring 13 decks and 13 sublight engines.<ref name="Galactic Starcruiser">[[Star Wars: Galactic Starcruiser|''Star Wars'': Galactic Starcruiser]]</ref> The vessel underwent its maiden voyage to Batuu.<ref name="SWGS Welcome Video">[[Star Wars: Galactic Starcruiser welcome video|''Star Wars'': Galactic Starcruiser welcome video]]</ref> Within its tenth year of operation, the ship was [[Defense of the Halcyon|rescued]] from [[Nihil]] pirates by [[Nib Assek]] and her [[Padawan]] [[Burryaga Agaburry|Burry]]. The ship's [[Lightsaber Training Pod]] was built in their honor.<ref name="Halcyon 1" />

In [[230 BBY]],<ref name="Timelines">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]''</ref> the ''Halcyon'' assisted in towing [[Starlight Beacon]] through [[hyperspace]] to help in the [[Dalnan evacuation]].<ref name="Mission to Disaster" />

===Clone Wars===
During the [[Clone Wars]], the ship was the site of a [[Skirmish on the Halcyon|skirmish]] between [[Galactic Republic|Republic]] and [[Confederacy of Independent Systems|Separatist]] agents. [[Jedi General]] [[Anakin Skywalker]] engaged in a [[lightsaber duel]] against [[Dark Acolyte]] [[Asajj Ventress]].<ref name="Halcyon 1" />

===Imperial Era===
Following its [[Declaration of a New Order|formation]], the [[Galactic Empire]] seized control of the ship, stripped the interior of much of its opulence, and used it as a retreat for [[Imperial officer]]s.<ref name="Dispatches" />

===New Republic Era===
During the [[New Republic Era|age]] of the [[New Republic]], the ''Halcyon'' was restored to its original design.<ref name="Dispatches" />

===A neo-Imperial crisis===
[[File:Halcyon-FOStormtroopers.jpg|thumb|right|250px|[[First Order stormtrooper]]s aboard the ''Halcyon'']]
For its [[Halcyon's 275th anniversary cruise|275th anniversary cruise]], the ''Halcyon'' was commanded by [[Captain]] [[Riyola Keevan]]. Its guests included the [[Twi'lek]] [[musician]] [[Gaya]], who sought the [[Hayananeya]] [[singing stone]] aboard the ship.<ref name="Galactic Starcruiser" /> A note posted in [[Oga's Cantina]] in [[Black Spire Outpost]] on the [[planet]] [[Batuu]] advertising a [[Technician|mechanic]] position on board the [[starship]] directed all applicants to contact Keevan. The job listing stated that applicants would need experience working on MPO-1400s and that the ability to speak [[Shyriiwook]] would be beneficial.<ref name="GE:OG" /> The [[First Order]] boarded the ''Halcyon'' during the cruise in search of [[Resistance]] agents, and the ship called at Batuu as both sides [[Battle of Batuu|clashed]] over the planet.<ref name="Galactic Starcruiser" />

