==Behind the scenes==
The ''Halcyon'' was the setting of the immersive [[The Walt Disney Company|Disney]] hotel [[Star Wars: Galactic Starcruiser|''Star Wars'': Galactic Starcruiser]] at the [[Wikipedia:Walt Disney World|Walt Disney World Resort]]. It was first revealed at D23 Expo [[2019]].<ref name="D23 Expo 2019" /> It was designed by [[Christian Alzmann]].<ref>{{Twitter|PhilSzostak|status/1164940565370171392|[[Phil Szostak]]|Starcruiser "Halcyon" concept art by design supervisor Christian Alzmann, modeled by concept modeler Rene Garcia, both members of Doug Chiang's Lucasfilm Art Department, my team. #StarWars #D23Expo|archivefile=File:Szostak08232019.png}}</ref> Decks 4-7 were available to guests. The starcruiser first appeared in the [[2022]] junior novel ''[[The High Republic: Mission to Disaster]]'', written by [[Justina Ireland]].<ref name="Mission to Disaster" />

